      "content": "i tried calling the nurse line but i've been on hold for like 20 minutes and i'm getting frustrated. i've had these allergies for years and i know how they feel. it feels way more like a seasonal thing than anything else. honestly, i just want to sleep it off. if i take 50mg of diphenhydramine instead of the usual 25mg, is that going to be a problem or is that just a normal way to deal with a bad flare up? it's not like i'm having trouble breathing or anything, just the tightness. can you just tell me if the dose is safe?",
